# Valkyrie's Call only looks at creatures "you control" (CR 603.10a, last known information): Bot1 Lightning Bolts Bot2's Memnite on
# turn 3 and nothing triggers, so it stays in Bot2's graveyard. On turn 5 the second Bolt kills Bot1's own Memnite and that one comes
# back as a 2/2 flying Angel (a positive control that the Call works in the same game).

